# Project intentions

Read [docs/INTENTIONS.md](docs/INTENTIONS.md) before expanding scope.

## Stay in v1/v2

Allowed: Grafana OSS image with the unsigned forecast plugin baked in (plus Druid and OpenSearch datasource plugins), baselines worker image, umbrella Helm chart with the worker as its own Deployment + headless Service (replicas independent of Grafana; rendezvous sharding; duplicate-tolerant ingestion), existing Kafka/Druid URLs in values, optional Prometheus / OpenSearch / Postgres datasource URLs (empty default). `postgres` values also provision the forecast snapshot store (app jsonData and Forecast datasource jsonData). This chart does not run Prom/OS/PG servers.

Do **not** add without updating INTENTIONS first:

- Plugin or worker source
- Kafka, ZooKeeper, or Druid
- Prometheus, OpenSearch, or Postgres servers
- Compose sandbox / TestData / demo dashboards
- Prometheus server or alerting in this chart
- Grafana.com signing
- arm64
- Worker HTTP endpoint
- Worker coordinator or leader election
- Service mesh or HPA tuning
